comments.body:
@reporter Well thank your for this issue anyway, I just ran into it and thought it was bun specific, which leads here if you add `bun` to any search engine.

I wanted to leave my comment for anyone that runs into the same problem as me. Also would like to point out that I mentioned `Windows` to `Linux` specifically but this also applies in `Linux` to `Linux` builds, since some packages may have different installations for different distributions/environments. Although this last one did not seem to be your case either, as your logs showed way too many packages failing for that to be the case.

Good luck on your new projects!
